  "body": "### Description\n\n`highlight_count` is not incremented when receiving a message that contains one of my keywords.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Add `yolo` as a keyword\r\n- Login to account A, and send a text message saying `yolo` in an unencrypted room \r\n- Login to account B\r\n\r\nI would expect to see the following in my sync response\r\n\r\n```jsonc\r\nunread_notifications: {notification_count: 1, highlight_count: 1}\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut I did receive\r\n\r\n```jsonc\r\nunread_notifications: {notification_count: 1, highlight_count: 0}\r\n```\n\n### Homeserver\n\nthreads-dev.lab.element.dev\n\n### Synapse Version\n\n{\"server_version\":\"1.69.0rc4\",\"python_version\":\"3.9.15\"}\n\n### Installation Method\n\n_No response_\n\n### Platform\n\nROSA\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\n?\n```\n\n\n### Anything else that would be useful to know?\n\n_No response_",
